    <uiIconPath>Things/Building/SpaceWeapons/PointDefense_MenuIcon</uiIconPath>
    <description>An autonomous laser turret dedicated to intercepting incoming missiles and other interceptable craft. It needs no crew or ammunition, but each shot draws stored energy.</description>
